@startsalt
' Screen: Script Graph Editor (main editor)
' User Stories:
'   - As a tester, I can view and edit a script's node graph
'   - As a tester, I can add nodes from a toolbar
'   - As a tester, I can select a version to view/edit
'   - As a tester, I can publish a draft script
'   - As a tester, I can export the script to YAML
'   - As a tester, I see validation warnings in the bottom bar

{
  ' ── TOP BAR ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  {
    <b>checkout-flow-test</b>  <i>/ checkout-flow-test</i>  |  ^v3 (draft)▼^  |  [Publish]  |  [Export YAML]
  }
  ==
  {
    ' ── LEFT TOOLBAR ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    {+
      <b>Add Node</b>
      ..
      [+ User Turn   ]
      [+ System      ]
      [+ Terminal    ]
      [+ Freeball ⚓ ]
      ==
      [⊞ Auto-layout ]
      ..
      [↩ Undo        ]
      [↪ Redo        ]
    }
    |
    ' ── MAIN CANVAS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    {+
      <i>Canvas — checkout-flow-test v3 (draft)</i>
      ..
      {T
        + [🔒 greeting]  <i>User Turn · greeting-prompt v2</i>
        ++ ──▶ match: intent=add_to_cart
        +++ [🎲 ask_quantity]  <i>User Turn · quantity-prompt v1</i>
        ++++ ──▶ match: regex \d+
        +++++ [🔒 confirm_order]  <i>System · confirm-prompt v3</i>
        ++++++ ──▶ match: always
        +++++++ [⬛ checkout_terminal]  <i>Terminal</i>
      }
      ..
      <i>4 nodes · 3 edges · drag canvas to pan · scroll to zoom</i>
    }
    |
    ' ── RIGHT INSPECTOR (collapsed) ─────────────────────────────────
    {+
      <b>Inspector</b>
      ..
      .
      .
      <i>Select a node</i>
      <i>to view details</i>
      .
      .
    }
  }
  ==
  ' ── VALIDATION BAR ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
  {
    <color:orange>⚠ 2 warnings</color>:  Node 'greeting' has no outgoing edge · Node 'ask_quantity' weight sum ≠ 1.0   |  [View All]
  }
}

@endsalt
